      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Matchstickman wrote:</b><br><blockquote>You can't go wrong with a Fallout game.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nFalse. Fallout Shelter is more boring than a solo game of LCR.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Remember that every vault was designed with a particular quirk in mind. &nbsp;Apply that to Fallout Shelter. &nbsp;Profit.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Some examples:</p>\n<p>Every wek send one person from each room out to yhe wastelands. &nbsp;Whoever survives the longest gets revived and brought back. &nbsp;Or maybe vice-versa!</p>\n<p>Pick a random room each day and have it rush until it maxes out its fail chance.</p>\n<p>build an elevator all the way to the bottom and rebuild the whole vault at the bottom instead of the top.</p>",
