      "created_at": "2015-08-14T16:35:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Donner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/48/1903_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Donner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Remember that every vault was designed with a particular quirk in mind. &nbsp;Apply that to Fallout Shelter. &nbsp;Profit.&nbsp;Some examples:Every wek send one person from each room out to yhe wastelands. &nbsp;Whoever survives the longest gets revived and brought back. &nbsp;Or maybe vice-versa!Pick a random room each day and have it rush until it maxes out its fail chance.build an elevator all the way to the bottom and rebuild the whole vault at the bottom instead of the top.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I refuse to play a game that forces me to create a game inside of it on my own in order to have fun. I'll stick to playing actual games.</p>",
